# Local-only dev scratch / operator docs — never push to the public repo.
# image*.png are pasted dev screenshots; LICENSE-KILL-SWITCH.md is the
# internal operator guide (bypass steps + key fingerprint) and lives with
# the key backups on the offline drive instead.
/image*.png
/LICENSE-KILL-SWITCH.md

# --- Frontend (Next.js source in frontend/) ---
/frontend/node_modules
/frontend/.next
/frontend/out

# --- Build output ---
# public/ is a build target: build-frontend.ps1 fills it with the Next.js
# static export. Track only Laravel's own files here; everything else is
# regenerated by the build.
/public/*
!/public/.htaccess
!/public/index.php
!/public/robots.txt
